.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-template-deploy - New server from a template


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro template deploy  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
New server from a template

.PP
A normal prepaid tr-ist-1 order (24-hour balance rule, account limits) installed from the template. \fBproduct_id\fR (or \fBplan\fR) from GET /cloud/products?region=tr-ist-1; its disk must be at least the template \fBmin_disk_gb\fR\&. Send \fB"confirm": true\fR and an \fBIdempotency-Key\fR header (\fBdry_run\fR for a quote).

.PP
API: POST /cloud/templates/{id}/servers (operationId createServerFromTemplate, scope cloud_order)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--data\fP=""
	request body as JSON, @file or @- (stdin)

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	show the price quote / request without changing anything

